          "headline": "Iran says Hormuz stays shut until the US meets its seven conditions",
          "summary": "Iran's security chief Mohsen Rezaei denied any talks with Washington or a meeting in Qatar, and said the strait will stay closed until the US accepts Tehran's terms, including lifting sanctions and the naval blockade. He also said Iran rejects a US idea to move its 60% enriched uranium abroad. This follows Rubio's remark that no major combat is needed; Trump says he sees positive momentum.",
